    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "MEMOJET A320\nO Jot your intra-office communiqué or top secret\nmessage. Fold down the middle, then fold corners into\nthe center crease so the planes align. Got your nose.\n2 Fold corners in to meet in\nthe middle and fold in half again.\nThat's one fine fuselage.\n* Get your wings by folding each side down\nthe dotted lines, then straighten out for that\naerodynamic silhouette.\nNOW YOU'RE\nCLEARED FOR\nDEPARTURE.\nHomE RiDIN\ndi gustice\nREADY. AIM. FLY.\nVIRGINAMERICA.COM\nNayan\namerica",
